<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Nebula's backdrop: the night sky the tile sits in. A violet well in the
     middle, near-black at the edges, and one warm ember at the top right where
     the moon is. The foreground carries the bun, so this only shows where a
     launcher mask crops harder than the artwork does. -->
